{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……ん？\r\nどうした、はるき？","trans":"……嗯？\n怎么了，阳希？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001510010","name":"はるき","text":"先生、今日の絵日記です","trans":"老师，这是今天的绘图日记","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001510020","name":"はるき","text":"講評お願いします……！","trans":"请给我点评……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ははっ、どれどれ……","trans":"哈哈，让我看看……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001510030","name":"はるき","text":"……わ、プロデューサーさんの絵\r\n可愛いですねぇ","trans":"……哇，制作人的画\n好可爱呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001510040","name":"はるき","text":"わたしのノート……\r\nえへへ……","trans":"我的笔记本……\n诶嘿嘿……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001510050","name":"はるき","text":"えへへ、そうですか……？","trans":"诶嘿嘿，是这样吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001510060","name":"はるき","text":"がんばりました……！","trans":"我很努力了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001510080","name":"はるき","text":"プロデューサーさんはこういうところを\r\n見てるんですねぇ……","trans":"制作人原来是看\n这些地方的呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}